@startuml
' Confirmation input handling; command validation and model deletion details are omitted.
hide footbox
skinparam defaultFontSize 14
skinparam maxMessageSize 160

actor User
participant ":BusyNotFree" as App
participant ":CommandHandler" as CH
participant ":Ui" as UI

User -> App : valid deletion request
activate App

App -> CH : execute(request)
activate CH

CH -> CH : validate and retain pending selection
activate CH
deactivate CH

CH -> UI : show deletion confirmation
activate UI
deactivate UI

CH --> App : false
deactivate CH

note over App, CH
  While confirmation is pending, normal command parsing
  and standalone save handling are bypassed.
end note

loop zero or more invalid confirmation answers
  User -> App : other input, including help / save / exit

  App -> CH : execute(input)
  activate CH

  CH -> UI : show error and repeat confirmation
  activate UI
  deactivate UI

  CH --> App : false
  deactivate CH
end

alt user confirms
  User -> App : yes

  App -> CH : execute("yes")
  activate CH

  CH -> CH : handleDeletionConfirmation("yes")
  activate CH

  note right of CH
    Model interactions are omitted here.
    See ProjectDeletionSequenceDiagram.
  end note

  CH -> UI : show deletion result
  activate UI
  deactivate UI
  deactivate CH

  CH --> App : false
  deactivate CH
else user cancels
  User -> App : no

  App -> CH : execute("no")
  activate CH

  CH -> CH : cancelPendingDeletion()
  activate CH

  CH -> UI : show cancellation message
  activate UI
  deactivate UI
  deactivate CH

  CH --> App : false
  deactivate CH
else input ends
  User -> App : end of input

  App -> CH : cancelPendingDeletion()
  activate CH

  CH -> UI : show cancellation message
  activate UI
  deactivate UI
  CH --> App
  deactivate CH

  App -> App : saveAndReportExit()
  activate App
  deactivate App
  deactivate App
  note right of App : run() returns after the save attempt\nbecause no further input is available.
end
@enduml
